  "footer": "<strong>This site is part of <a href=\"https://stemedplus.org/\">STEMEd+ Commons</a>, a Commons within <a href=\"https://hcommons.org/\">Knowledge Commons</a>. STEMEd+ Commons brings together teachers, researchers, and learning professionals from every field to share work, find each other, and build what comes next. As an open access platform, STEMEd+ Commons helps ensure STEM+ teaching and STEM+ education research are accessible for all people, in all communities. This material is based upon work supported by the National Science Foundation under grants </strong><a href=\"https://www.nsf.gov/awardsearch/show-award/?AWD_ID=2226271\">OAC-2226271</a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"https://www.nsf.gov/awardsearch/show-award/?AWD_ID=2321946\">DRL-2321946</a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"https://www.nsf.gov/awardsearch/show-award/?AWD_ID=2531819\">OAC-2531819</a> and by Michigan State University through the <a href=\"https://research.msu.edu/find-funding/msu-funding-opportunities/jenison-support\">Jenison Fund</a>."
